  "body": "Bathed in sunlight and designed for modern living, this single-level home is a rare find with a private Kwila deck embraced by the house in a U-shape, high ceilings, a stylish kitchen, and a double garage.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a bright and airy open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area. The kitchen is a true highlight, featuring stone benchtops, sleek cabinetry, and modern appliances, perfectly balancing style and functionality. Large sliding doors open onto the sun-filled Kwila deck, seamlessly extending the living space outdoors and creating an ideal setting for entertaining or relaxing in privacy.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom enjoys its own peaceful retreat with an ensuite, a walk-in wardrobe and deck access. Three additional bedrooms are generous in size and served by a full family bathroom.\r\n\r\nA double internal-access garage adds convenience, and the low-maintenance outdoor areas make it easy to enjoy the lifestyle this home offers.\r\n\r\nLocated close to local schools, parks, beaches, and shopping centres, with easy access to the motorway, this home combines convenience with comfort.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light, thoughtfully designed, and affordable, it’s perfect for families or investors seeking a smart and stylish home in a thriving area.\r\n\r\nContact us now to arrange your viewing today.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
